{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<img alt=\"有片｜神舟二十四號點火升空　約18分鐘後進入預定軌道\" src=\"https://news.now.com/nownews/NewsImage/2026-11-25-11-08-26tcfyacI2.jpg\"><p>【Now新聞台】神舟二十四號於上午8時18分點火升空後，於上午8時36分順利進入預定軌道。酒泉衛星發射中心主任宣布，神二十四發射任務圓滿成功。</p><p>神二十四點火後升空，到助推器分離、整流罩與火箭分離、船箭分離、太陽帆板展開，到進入預定軌道，整個過程歷時約18分鐘。</p><p></p></body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-25T03:23:54.281783+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":130,"images":1,"source":"Now 國際","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-25T00:44:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-25T06:37:32.776213+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-25T03:17:22.629937+00:00","content_hash":"9821781d41b941714c581d89e47e0225f85ec13720fa3daf2061183714ec0208","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}